<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17545" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτ-άγρετος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγρέω</span>) poet. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐθαίρετος,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>self-chosen, left to one's
				choice,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ γάρ πως εἴη αὐτάγρετα πάντα
					βροτοῖσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					16.148
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοὶ δ᾽ αὐτάγρετόν ἐστι δαήμεναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Merc.</u>
					474
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>taken by one's own hands</i> or <i>exertions,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.231
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>choosing freely,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Semon.
				1.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				5.588
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
